{"version":1,"content":"<p>一名同德GeForce RTX 5090 GameRock OC用户稱，返修顯卡更換的12VHPWR接口在首次開機後從PCB上脱離。顯卡再次送檢後，英國零售商Overclockers UK據稱仍以物理損壞為由判定保修失效，用户已要求管理層介入。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586808.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T16:37:33.462838+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T16:12:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T16:30:39.304258+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T16:30:39.304258+00:00","content_hash":"7901eb71bc60659ef5a3240ad4cc06257736be0d8c6261ad587cbe757a470967","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}